<h1>@Localizer["Geometry, rigidity and workholding"]</h1>
<p class="docs-lead">@Localizer["Consider tool access and how the part is supported throughout the cut, not only the final shape. These design reviews connect thin features and deep pockets to fixturing, distortion and vibration."]</p>
<figure class="docs-figure knowledge-photo">
    <img src="/src/images/knowledge/photos/workholding.webp" srcset="/src/images/knowledge/photos/workholding-small.webp 768w, /src/images/knowledge/photos/workholding.webp 1536w" sizes="(min-width: 72rem) calc(100vw - 25rem), calc(100vw - 4rem)" alt="@Localizer["A thin aluminium frame is supported and clamped on a fixture plate."]" width="1536" height="1024" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />
    <figcaption>@Localizer["Support the part through the machining sequence, including its least rigid stage. Illustrative image."]</figcaption>
</figure>
